@startuml
title VOPC - UC-16 Manage workload configuration (conceptual)
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class "Workload configuration UI" as UI <<boundary>>
class "Workload configuration" as Config <<control>>
class "Reference catalog" as Catalog <<control>>
class "Desired workload change" as Change <<entity>>
interface "Desired configuration store" as Store

UI --> Config : validate/save/delete
UI --> Catalog : scoped UC-12 keys and other sources
Config --> Catalog : verify references
Config --> Store : persist pending change
Store ..> Change
@enduml
